Build-time components, not redistributed
---------------------------------------

The following are used while building the Software but are not included in any
published StringGuard artifact. They are declared `compileOnly`, so they are
neither bundled nor imposed as dependencies on your build.

  Kotlin compiler (kotlin-compiler-embeddable), Apache License 2.0
  Kotlin Gradle plugin and its API, Apache License 2.0
  Gradle API, Apache License 2.0

The JavaScript and WebAssembly test toolchain resolved by the Kotlin Gradle
plugin, recorded in `kotlin-js-store/yarn.lock`, is likewise build-time only
and is not part of any published artifact.
